WEBVTT

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.330
Baby Flame!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:10.340
Got 'im!

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.220
Tortomon

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.220
Adult Level

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.550
Where d'you think you're looking?

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:20.180
Here it comes!

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.070
The Digisoul!

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:30.110
Agumon, you okay?

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:33.280
Yeah, I'm good!

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:33.610
Right!

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:35.990
Let's go, you bastard!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:41.980
Digisoul Charge!

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.990
Agumon, evolve!

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:53.290
GeoGreymon!

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:12.940
All right!

00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:15.360
Mega Burst!

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:25.710
Geez...

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.710
I told him so many times to wait until we joined up...

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:32.880
You totally destroyed the place!

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:35.810
Did you even think for a second about the reconstruction?

00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:37.300
Well, say something!

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.210
We win!

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:41.150
Yup!

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:42.710
You two...

00:01:43.230 --> 00:01:46.130
You should be more discreet when fighting Digimon.

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:48.260
It's not just about getting it done quickly.

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:49.880
Aw, he's annoyed at himself.

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:51.670
Yeah, he's annoyed!

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.330
That's not it!

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:56.320
If you fight on your own and it gets bad, what'll you do then?

00:01:57.480 --> 00:02:01.650
As if any Digimon could beat us when we're fighting together!

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:04.770
Yeah! Because we're the strongest combination ever!

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:05.290
Ever!

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:09.090
This is the worst...

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:10.750
That's my line.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.750
This is great!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.910
Mom, your fried eggs are really the best!

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.110
Yeah, yeah!

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.700
Sayuri is a genius at making fried eggs!

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:24.210
Hey, how many times do I have to tell you not to call my mom by her first name?

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.370
But Sayuri is Sayuri.

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:27.470
Chika is Chika.

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:28.910
And Aniki is Aniki.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.490
That's not what I mean!

00:02:30.490 --> 00:02:32.560
You're really pigging out...

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.230
Hey, that was the last one!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.610
First come, first served!

00:02:39.610 --> 00:02:40.440
What?!

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.500
It's manners for the follower to hold back!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.440
Look who's talking!

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.230
Giving things to his follower shows off an aniki's generosity!

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.890
My point is, you eat too much!

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.410
Three times more than a regular freeloader!

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:51.030
You're getting a big attitude!

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.230
Oh my, they really know what they're talking about...

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.230
So are you!

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.180
Well, you talk too much in your sleep! I can't get a good night's rest anymore!

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:55.470
That's because they saw it on TV yesterday.

00:02:55.470 --> 00:02:58.500
Still, it's amazing that they're studying while watching TV.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:02:58.180
You snore too loud!

00:02:58.180 --> 00:03:00.790
You're even worse, you sound like an elephant!

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.680
Mom...

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:04.520
Well, I'm not gonna bail you out any more, Aniki!

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.470
If I wasn't there for you today, you would've been screwed!

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:08.700
What?!

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.200
Don't be so damn egotistical!

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.720
You can't even evolve without my Digisoul!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:17.850
Damn it!

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:18.920
I can't do this any more!

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:20.240
I'm done being your follower!

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.250
Oh yeah, well, I'm out too!

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.700
We're not Aniki and follower any more!

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:26.690
We're through!

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.580
So that's why you're in there right now?

00:03:32.180 --> 00:03:33.770
This is troublesome...

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:35.680
They're such children.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:39.550
I'm shocked.

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.400
Me too.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.060
I mean, can you believe Agumon?

00:03:43.060 --> 00:03:44.180
The same can be said for you.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:46.110
You're arguing over something so trivial.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:47.550
It's not my fault!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:48.560
It is!

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:49.650
It's all your fault, Aniki!

00:03:49.650 --> 00:03:50.570
Shut up!

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:52.580
We have nothing to do with each other anymore, so quit talking to me!

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:55.230
Let's see you beat a Digimon by yourself!

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:59.890
Fine! I'm more than enough for one or two Digimon!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:07.870
We'll see about that, Aniki!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.490
What's going on?

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:12.580
Is there an accident?

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:16.440
Hey, if we can't even move, then screw the traffic lights!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.990
Screw the traffic lights!

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:32.580
The Masaru-Agumon Combination Destroyed?!

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:32.580
Hurricane, Garurumon

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:31.230
The Masaru-Agumon Combination Destroyed?!

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:32.530
Hurricane, Garurumon!

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:42.300
Now there'll be peace once again in the Daimon family.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:48.540
I'll do it all by myself.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.490
Hey, Agumon-chan.

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:52.680
Aren't you hungry?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.560
How about a snack?

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:57.870
Look, a special triple-meat burger!

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.550
You can eat as much as you want!

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:01.190
Shut up! Leave me alone!

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:04.120
No choice then...

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:06.910
Agumon-chan, we'll be eating some first, okay?

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.950
How will they ever make up?

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:14.020
It's not something we should interfere with.

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:17.670
But we can't let it go on like this.

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:20.190
They must learn why they're important to each other.

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:23.420
If they don't find that answer, this is as far as they go.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:33.970
That little shithead.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:38.180
He was the one who first said he wanted to be my follower.

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:41.710
Damn it!

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:48.920
Agumon, your actions are incomprehensible.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:53.200
You always said you hated being in the Digivice because you were alone.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:55.080
You two wouldn't understand!

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:56.700
That's for sure.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:58.480
But that's why I'm interested.

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:00.290
Just leave me alone.

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:05.090
Fighting with your master, hiding out in the Digivice...

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:07.050
There are many things about this I can't analyze.

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:08.860
You've never had fights before, Gaomon?

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.860
I have them every day.

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.350
Interesting.

00:07:12.350 --> 00:07:14.260
Tell me the reason why.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.690
Yoshino's always really lazy!

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:21.270
She doesn't clean up her room, she doesn't fold up her laundry, she has bad sleeping habits and-

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:22.730
Hey, you!

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.060
Don't go telling others about my private life!

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.190
It hurts! It hurts!

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:31.270
Did you see that homerun?

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:33.160
If it'd just- ow!

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:33.820
Hey, you! Stop!

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:38.710
Da... Daimon!

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:40.600
Katsumata?

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:43.260
You're still hanging 'round here?

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:45.630
W-Wait!

00:07:52.540 --> 00:07:53.800
What bad luck.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.530
Cursing your fate won't do you any good.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:07:58.910
I was talking about you.

00:07:59.530 --> 00:08:02.480
I'm extremely pissed off right now!

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:09.250
Everything would be sorted out if you just came out of there.

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:12.230
I'm never doing that until Aniki apologizes!

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:14.200
Fine, stay in there forever.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:19.280
Aniki hurt my pride.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:22.830
<i>You can't even evolve without my Digisoul!</i>

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.170
What's wrong?

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:35.590
Done already?

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:48.640
Young man!

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.730
Have your troubles ended?

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:54.300
The old man with the Digivice?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.360
What're you doing now?

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:59.120
Just what it looks like, fortune-telling.

00:08:59.120 --> 00:08:59.990
Let me see...

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.670
You're looking for something, aren't you?

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.210
It's got nothing to do with you.

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:09.250
It's a pity, but they're always where you can't find them.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:13.960
The things you truly need appear even when you're not looking for them.

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:17.370
That's because you understand why you need them.

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:21.910
If you don't, it means you've never really needed them in the first place.

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:23.770
You talk too much.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.100
Does he or does he not understand?

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.820
Damn that Daimon!

00:09:37.820 --> 00:09:39.770
He won't get off easy next time!

00:09:42.370 --> 00:09:44.780
Damn it, the stupid light's taking too long again!

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:45.750
Come on, change!

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.560
Lights, change!

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:50.880
What the hell?!

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:58.340
Elecmon

00:09:52.790 --> 00:09:58.340
Child Level

00:09:56.640 --> 00:09:58.340
Lights, change!

00:10:16.450 --> 00:10:19.110
A Digimon signal detected within the city, Area B-4!

00:10:19.670 --> 00:10:22.220
They keep coming daily...

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:23.610
Where's Masaru?

00:10:23.610 --> 00:10:25.120
I can't contact him!

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.000
No choice then.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.970
You two, get there right away.

00:10:28.970 --> 00:10:30.180
Understood.

00:10:30.180 --> 00:10:30.540
Me too!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.570
Wait, that's right.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.300
I decided I wouldn't come out until Aniki apologizes.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:46.010
This is terrible!

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:48.450
A Digimon?

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.520
What?

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.360
The lights...

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:54.270
That guy...!

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:55.580
Wait up!

00:10:57.000 --> 00:10:59.190
Digimon analysis confirmed!

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:03.050
Elecmon. A Child Level, Mammal type Digimon.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:06.690
He can use electricity to jam signals!

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:08.080
That's why the lights...

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:11.680
The target's moving from Area C-4 to Area D-6.

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:12.250
Understood.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:36.230
It's okay.

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:37.840
You're not hurt anywhere.

00:11:42.720 --> 00:11:43.700
You son of a...

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:46.910
Look after her!

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:51.330
You're not getting away! Let's go, Agumon!

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:01.220
Oh yeah... we separated.

00:12:01.220 --> 00:12:02.670
I'll do this on my own!

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:17.350
The target's energy readings are increasing.

00:12:17.350 --> 00:12:18.270
Currently at 250.

00:12:19.220 --> 00:12:21.480
Damn it... I should be...

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:23.030
The target has stopped!

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.040
He's at Area E, on a telegraph pole!

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:26.480
Telegraph pole?

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:28.190
This isn't good, Satsuma.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:30.560
I can see the place.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.910
We'll be there soon.

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:34.660
We can't let the target escape any further.

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:35.640
Hurry and secure him.

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:36.600
Understood.

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:38.130
Huh? Masaru?

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:39.290
Aniki!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.480
Damn! Where'd it go?

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:47.350
Masaru!

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.460
Where have you been, not contacting us?

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:51.370
Oh, Yoshino and Tohma!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.680
The Digimon's hiding over here!

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:55.330
We already know that.

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:58.790
You don't have a partner, so just wait here.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.050
Even if Agumon's not around, I can handle this myself!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:07.780
Damn! He's...!

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:16.330
He's evolving?

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.310
He sucked in the electricity... and evolved?

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:38.850
This is the worst.

00:13:39.280 --> 00:13:42.460
Garurumon. An Adult Level, Beast type Digimon.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.790
His stiff fur acts as a strong defense.

00:13:45.790 --> 00:13:49.530
He also has a fierce battle instinct and is highly intelligent.

00:13:50.200 --> 00:13:53.240
It's a pity GeoGreymon isn't there.

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.210
Garurumon (Black)

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.210
Adult Level

00:13:58.890 --> 00:13:59.990
You bastard!

00:13:59.990 --> 00:14:01.190
Stand back, Masaru!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:03.570
You can't do this without a partner!

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:11.520
Digisoul Charge!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.730
Gaomon, evolve!

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:20.310
Gaogamon!

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:28.520
Digisoul Charge!

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.460
Lalamon, evolve!

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:40.860
Sunflowmon!

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:43.830
Get back, Masaru!

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:45.620
Leave this to us!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:56.490
<i>I'm not gonna bail you out any more, Aniki!</i>

00:14:59.290 --> 00:15:00.100
Move!

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:00.850
Masaru?

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.870
You're the ones who should get back!

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:05.650
I'll take this guy out by myself!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.440
Don't be absurd!

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:10.220
Even if I am, I'll use it to cut through a new path!

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.710
That's what a man does!

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.600
Sunflowmon! Stop Masaru!

00:15:19.940 --> 00:15:20.920
Gaogamon!

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.460
Sunflowmon!

00:15:28.420 --> 00:15:29.170
You son of a bitch!

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:31.630
I'm your opponent!

00:15:33.050 --> 00:15:35.350
Is this all you can do to shake me off?!

00:15:35.900 --> 00:15:37.410
I can't believe it.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:41.100
Gaogamon and Sunflowmon look like they can still battle.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.520
But they can't attack Garurumon like that!

00:15:44.150 --> 00:15:46.810
Does Masaru really believe that he can win?

00:15:47.440 --> 00:15:49.110
Aniki...

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:53.540
What's wrong?

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:55.910
Come on, just try and shake me off!

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:58.330
Masaru!

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:06.540
Garurumon, with Masaru on top, is moving to Area D-17.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.210
Send Yoshino and Tohma there.

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:09.000
Understood.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.660
Yoshino, respond.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:12.120
Yoshino here.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:14.540
The target is moving to Area D-17.

00:16:14.540 --> 00:16:15.770
Pursue him.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:17.190
Roger.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:19.070
Aniki...

00:16:22.650 --> 00:16:24.970
Garurumon's speed has changed.

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:26.350
He's much faster than before!

00:16:26.770 --> 00:16:30.150
Garurumon is going along railway 145.

00:16:30.150 --> 00:16:31.150
He's heading north.

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.600
Garurumon isn't stopping.

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:35.270
That Masaru...

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:39.610
Facing off a Digimon on his own... how rash can he be?

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:41.910
I hope you're safe!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.750
Hey asshole, how far are you gonna go?

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.700
Stop sometime!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:51.870
Damn, my arms are giving out!

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.020
Are you trying to see which of us lasts longer?

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:58.950
He's almost at the northernmost point of railway 145.

00:16:58.950 --> 00:17:00.760
He's reaching a station that is under construction.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:05.100
This is the end of our little race!

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:27.010
Hey...

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:29.080
Don't underestimate me!

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.580
Take this!

00:17:38.400 --> 00:17:40.260
All right, let's go, Agumon!

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:43.970
Damn, what do I do now?

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.840
Damn it!

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:53.400
Am I not...

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:57.870
strong enough to beat him...?

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:03.370
Is it really only a Digimon that can stop a Digimon...?

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:06.750
Damn it!

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:13.960
Damn it...!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:15.920
<i>Baby Flame!</i>

00:18:23.710 --> 00:18:27.460
<i>Damn it!!!</i>

00:18:29.280 --> 00:18:31.980
I was wrong...

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:33.400
I need...

00:18:36.470 --> 00:18:41.110
<i>As if any Digimon could beat us when we're fighting together!</i>

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:45.080
